   "size": "close",
   "key": 41,
   "len": 66,
   "first": 1417,
   "line": "By crashing into it. On purpose.",
   "note": "ch1"
  },
  {
   "id": "S18",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 64,
   "len": 104,
   "first": 1483,
   "line": "Nobody had ever tried it. Now, you go.",
   "note": "ch1"
  },
  {
   "id": "S19",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 27,
   "len": 43,
   "first": 1587,
   "line": "First, you need a ride.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S20",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 86,
   "len": 139,
   "first": 1630,
   "line": "A Falcon Nine rocket, on the twenty-third of November, twenty twenty-one.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S21",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 43,
   "len": 69,
   "first": 1769,
   "line": "Ten twenty-one at night, from California.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S22",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 35,
   "len": 56,
   "first": 1838,
   "line": "Three. Two. One.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S23",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 24,
   "len": 38,
   "first": 1894,
   "line": "And you rise.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S24",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 80,
   "first": 1932,
   "line": "Then the rocket lets go. You are alone.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S25",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 70,
   "len": 113,
   "first": 2012,
   "line": "Your wings unfold. Gold, glittering, enormous.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S26",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 32,
   "len": 52,
   "first": 2125,
   "line": "There is a long way to go.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S27",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 40,
   "len": 65,
   "first": 2177,
   "line": "Ten months of nothing but stars.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S28",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 64,
   "len": 104,
   "first": 2242,
   "line": "Your calendar flips. And flips. And flips.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S29",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 48,
   "len": 78,
   "first": 2346,
   "line": "Then something appears ahead. A speck.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S30",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 65,
   "len": 105,
   "first": 2424,
   "line": "That speck is home. Your target.",
   "note": "ch2"
  },
  {
   "id": "S31",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 68,
   "len": 109,
   "first": 2529,
   "line": "It is September, twenty twenty-two. The speck grows.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S32",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 62,
   "len": 100,
   "first": 2638,
   "line": "Now it is two rocks. A big one and a small one.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S33",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 44,
   "len": 71,
   "first": 2738,
   "line": "Your camera locks onto the small one.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S34",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 39,
   "len": 63,
   "first": 2809,
   "line": "The last seconds are all yours.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S35",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 67,
   "first": 2872,
   "line": "Home is a very long way behind you.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S36",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 51,
   "len": 83,
   "first": 2939,
   "line": "Every correction is yours to make, alone.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S37",
   "size": "panr",
   "key": 49,
   "len": 79,
   "first": 3022,
   "line": "One bad nudge, and you sail past.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S38",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 82,
   "len": 133,
   "first": 3101,
   "line": "The moon fills your view. A hundred and fifty-one metres of boulders.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S39",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 57,
   "len": 92,
   "first": 3234,
   "line": "You can see the shadows now. Every crater.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S40",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 65,
   "len": 105,
   "first": 3326,
   "line": "You are going six point one kilometres every second.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S41",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 56,
   "len": 90,
   "first": 3431,
   "line": "That is more than twenty-one thousand kilometres an hour.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S42",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 55,
   "len": 89,
   "first": 3521,
   "line": "Fourteen thousand miles an hour, if you like miles.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S43",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 74,
   "len": 120,
   "first": 3610,
   "line": "Ten seconds out. The ground is a wall of rock.",
   "note": "ch3"
  },
  {
   "id": "S44",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 39,
   "len": 63,
   "first": 3730,
   "line": "Three. Two. One.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S45",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 17,
   "len": 28,
   "first": 3793,
   "line": "Contact.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S46",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 73,
   "len": 118,
   "first": 3821,
   "line": "Your five hundred eighty kilograms hit like a hammer made of speed.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S47",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 51,
   "len": 82,
   "first": 3939,
   "line": "Dust and rock fly out into space.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S48",
   "size": "panr",
   "key": 63,
   "len": 102,
   "first": 4021,
   "line": "A long tail of debris, streaming away from the moon.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S49",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 38,
   "len": 61,
   "first": 4123,
   "line": "Mission control goes silent.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S50",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 26,
   "len": 42,
   "first": 4184,
   "line": "Then the room erupts.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S51",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 43,
   "len": 69,
   "first": 4226,
   "line": "You hit. But did it move?",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S52",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 58,
   "len": 93,
   "first": 4295,
   "line": "Nobody can see the moon move. It is too far.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S53",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 53,
   "len": 85,
   "first": 4388,
   "line": "So scientists wait, and time its orbit.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S54",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 60,
   "len": 96,
   "first": 4473,
   "line": "Before the hit, one loop took a certain time.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S55",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 39,
   "len": 63,
   "first": 4569,
   "line": "Now the stopwatch is running again.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S56",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 45,
   "len": 72,
   "first": 4632,
   "line": "And the answer is coming.",
   "note": "ch4"
  },
  {
   "id": "S57",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 59,
   "len": 95,
   "first": 4704,
   "line": "The moon's orbit got shorter by thirty-three minutes.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S58",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 30,
   "len": 49,
   "first": 4799,
   "line": "Give or take one minute.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S59",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 53,
   "len": 85,
   "first": 4848,
   "line": "That was far more than scientists expected.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S60",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 73,
   "len": 118,
   "first": 4933,
   "line": "Thirty-three minutes. That is a whole episode of a sitcom.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S61",
   "size": "pan",
   "key": 45,
   "len": 72,
   "first": 5051,
   "line": "You shoved a rock, and the rock moved.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S62",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 53,
   "len": 85,
   "first": 5123,
   "line": "No one had ever done that to a world before.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S63",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 66,
   "len": 106,
   "first": 5208,
   "line": "The first object in the Solar System we measurably nudged.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S64",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 65,
   "len": 105,
   "first": 5314,
   "line": "Think about that. A spacecraft smaller than a car.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S65",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 56,
   "len": 90,
   "first": 5419,
   "line": "Moved a rock a hundred and fifty metres wide.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S66",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 37,
   "len": 59,
   "first": 5509,
   "line": "But the story does not end there.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S67",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 82,
   "len": 132,
   "first": 5568,
   "line": "Four years later, a visitor arrives to survey the damage.",
   "note": "ch5"
  },
  {
   "id": "S68",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 53,
   "len": 85,
   "first": 5700,
   "line": "Meet Hera. A European spacecraft.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S69",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 74,
   "first": 5785,
   "line": "Its job is a crash site investigation.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S70",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 35,
   "len": 57,
   "first": 5859,
   "line": "It took two years to get there.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S71",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 66,
   "len": 106,
   "first": 5916,
   "line": "It sits one hundred ninety-six million kilometres from Earth.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S72",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 39,
   "len": 63,
   "first": 6022,
   "line": "This week it sent back a picture.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S73",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 74,
   "len": 120,
   "first": 6085,
   "line": "It shows Didymos, the big rock, from a side no one had seen.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S74",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 54,
   "len": 87,
   "first": 6205,
   "line": "DART's camera only ever saw the other face.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S75",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 58,
   "len": 94,
   "first": 6292,
   "line": "The first thing the Hera scientists said was wow.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S76",
   "size": "panr",
   "key": 42,
   "len": 67,
   "first": 6386,
   "line": "It has the same ridge around its middle.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S77",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 35,
   "len": 56,
   "first": 6453,
   "line": "But everything else looks different.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S78",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 64,
   "len": 104,
   "first": 6509,
   "line": "Boulders. Craters. Strange grooves and ridges.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S79",
   "size": "tilt",
   "key": 63,
   "len": 102,
   "first": 6613,
   "line": "Here is the mystery. Did your crash cause some of it?",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S80",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 68,
   "len": 109,
   "first": 6715,
   "line": "The debris you kicked up may have crossed one kilometre of space.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S81",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 52,
   "len": 84,
   "first": 6824,
   "line": "And landed on Didymos. Scarring it.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S82",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 37,
   "len": 60,
   "first": 6908,
   "line": "Hera will map every change.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S83",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 67,
   "len": 108,
   "first": 6968,
   "line": "Next reveal: the twenty-fifth of November.",
   "note": "ch6"
  },
  {
   "id": "S84",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 35,
   "len": 57,
   "first": 7076,
   "line": "Why does any of this matter?",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S85",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 53,
   "len": 85,
   "first": 7133,
   "line": "One day, an asteroid might be heading for Earth.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S86",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 45,
   "len": 72,
   "first": 7218,
   "line": "A hit like yours could nudge it away.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S87",
   "size": "insert",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 80,
   "first": 7290,
   "line": "It is called kinetic impact deflection.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S88",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 39,
   "len": 63,
   "first": 7370,
   "line": "DART proved it works once.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S89",
   "size": "low",
   "key": 60,
   "len": 97,
   "first": 7433,
   "line": "Hera helps scientists make it work every time.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S90",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 51,
   "len": 82,
   "first": 7530,
   "line": "A one-off demo becomes a dependable shield.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S91",
   "size": "wide",
   "key": 46,
   "len": 75,
   "first": 7612,
   "line": "And it all started with a little spacecraft.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S92",
   "size": "pullout",
   "key": 50,
   "len": 80,
   "first": 7687,
   "line": "Remember that fourteen thousand miles an hour?",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S93",
   "size": "high",
   "key": 74,
   "len": 119,
   "first": 7767,
   "line": "Now you know where it ends. A rock, a shove, a new orbit.",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S94",
   "size": "close",
   "key": 51,
   "len": 83,
   "first": 7886,
   "line": "Tomorrow: what if you flew straight into the Sun?",
   "note": "ch7"
  },
  {
   "id": "S95",
   "size": "med",
   "key": 83,
   "len": 134,
   "first": 7969,
   "line": "Which world would you crash into first? Tell me below.",
   "note": "ch7"
  }
 ],
 "fx": [],
